    <failure>sqlite://file.db drifted from the expected state at version 2 with 2 change(s): 2 extra&#xA;&#xA;The database diverged from the expected state as if the following were executed:&#xA;  -- extra function &#34;f&#34;:&#xA;    -&gt; CREATE FUNCTION &#34;f&#34; (integer) RETURNS integer LANGUAGE sql AS $$ SELECT $1 $$;&#xA;  -- extra table &#34;t$CI_PROJECT_ID&#34;:&#xA;    -&gt; CREATE TABLE &#34;t$CI_PROJECT_ID&#34; (&#34;c%CI_PROJECT_ID%&#34; int NULL);</failure>
  </testcase>
</testsuite>
